# Task: Verify Speckit addin renders on Backlog page

## Goal
Prove the whole flow works: registry -> install -> load -> backlog contribution -> UI render.

## Steps
1. Run daemon-core-public operator dashboard in dev.
2. Install/enable the `speckit` addin via the supported mechanism.
3. Open Backlog page and confirm Speckit items appear.
4. Test refresh/reload: items should not duplicate.
5. Test missing data source scenario: addin should fail gracefully.

## Evidence
Include either:
- screenshots of Backlog showing Speckit items, or
- logs demonstrating successful addin invocation + returned item list.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Speckit items visible
- [ ] No duplicates on refresh
- [ ] Graceful empty state
